OL,3,GNEWSACouncil backs watchdog probe of
OL,4,Afraud investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMedway councillors have voted to ask a
OL,7,Fpolice watchdog to intervene in the
OL,8,Fhandling of a major fraud
OL,9,Finvestigation.
OL,11,FMembers of Medway Council will ask the
OL,12,FIndependent Office of Police Conduct
OL,13,F(IOPC) to investigate why detectives
OL,14,Fdropped a case into accusations of
OL,15,Ffinancial wrongdoing at Medway
OL,16,FCommercial Group (MCG) after seven
OL,17,Fyears.
OL,19,FKent Police said it was shelving the
OL,20,Fcase as it did not meet the evidential
OL,21,Fstandards to proceed, according to the
OL,22,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
