OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil backs watchdog probe of
OL,4,Afraud investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMedway Council will write to the IOPC
OL,7,Fcomplaining the investigation was
OL,8,F"poorly resourced, ineffectively
OL,9,Fconducted and managed, and lacked the
OL,10,Fcharacteristics of a thorough,
OL,11,Feffective and/or efficient process".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
